(92, 2, 2145390335, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2000, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 0, 1118, 0.0, 0.0, 5, 5, 'Gelkis Clan Centaur', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 16712190, 'These centaur have made their home in the southern region of Desolace.  Mortal enemies of the Magram Centaur.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 16712190),
